The XML schemas in this folder are the transitional schemas of ECMA-376,
Office Open XML File Formats, 5th edition, Part 4 (Transitional Migration
Features), Annex A, as Ecma International publishes them in
OfficeOpenXML-XMLSchema-Transitional.zip inside
https://ecma-international.org/wp-content/uploads/ECMA-376-4_5th_edition_december_2016.zip
(sha256 of the inner zip: d34187520749998af306faf1b730e568b0ca6d88ad24638a407c0a9bb4ca04fc).
They are copied unchanged, byte for byte; their sha256 sums follow the
notice. The file-tools server reads them to check that documents follow the
standard.

The files carry no notice of their own. Ecma's text copyright policy
applies its default notice to the standards published before it was
written; that notice follows, as the policy gives it.

